{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount a member pays each year is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-61b490336159750b14db8f38a399eb0b6ed92bbe \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n\nThe charter does not state the membership fee amount explicitly. Therefore, the membership fee amount is not specified in the charter. [[cite:obs-61b490336159750b14db8f38a399eb0b6ed92bbe \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"d079ee85886b23122ca13a615e1472e922ad69070b03cada2562546b9f840a99","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution and that the amount is fixed in the annex, but it does not specify the membership fee amount (e.g., 120 EUR). The summary was amended to reflect only what the charter states, with exact citations."}